 "stimulus_html": "<figure id=\"Ch16_fig07\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/7f3312b2367c68f6.png\" alt=\"A chart shows the bandwidths (in kilobits per second) for different countries in the years 1986, 2001, and 2014. The measurements for the year 1986 are as follows: Others 29, United States 27, Japan 11, France 7, Germany 6, U.K. 5, Russia 4, Canada 3. The measurements for the year 2001 are as follows: Others 30, United States 17, China 14, Japan 10, Germany 7, South Korea 6, Italy 4, U.K. 4, France 4, Brazil 2. The measurements for the year 2014 are as follows: China 29, others 27, United States 13, Japan 8, Republic of Korea 8, Russia 4.\">\n<figcaption>Top 10 countries with most installed bandwidth (in kbps) in 1986, 2001, and 2014. (credit: “Bandwidths” by Bill of Rights Institute/Flickr, CC BY 4.0)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the chart provided.</i></p>",
